================================================================
NO WARRANTY, IN PLAIN ENGLISH
================================================================

This app enlarges photos by inventing detail that was never in
the original. It can produce results that are wrong, ugly, or
unusable, and it can fail on some images or some computers.

It is provided free and as-is. Keep your original photos. Do not
rely on its output for anything where being wrong matters.
